lycantropy-heal-allies-name = Heal allies
lycantropy-heal-allies-desc = Gain the ability to heal all other werewolves within range.

lycantropy-steel-claws-name = Steel claws
lycantropy-steel-claws-desc = Your claws become razor-sharp, increasing the damage of your attacks.

lycantropy-long-jump-name = Long lunge
lycantropy-long-jump-desc = Your lunges become longer.

lycantropy-thick-fur-name = Thick fur
lycantropy-thick-fur-desc = Your thick fur increases your health.

lycantropy-stone-claws-name = Stonecutting claws
lycantropy-stone-claws-desc = Your claws grow strong enough to smash through obstacles.

lycantropy-regen-name = Regeneration
lycantropy-regen-desc = Gain the ability to restore a portion of your health.

lycantropy-blood-feel-name = Blood sense
lycantropy-blood-feel-desc = Gain the ability to track your victims by the scent of blood.

lycantropy-hot-blood-name = Hot blood
lycantropy-hot-blood-desc = Gain the ability to increase your speed for a short time.

lycantropy-shadow-dash-name = Shadow lunge
lycantropy-shadow-dash-desc = Gain the ability to stun your target when lunging.

lycantropy-blood-hunt-name = Blood hunt
lycantropy-blood-hunt-desc = Enter hunting mode: lunges no longer deal stamina damage to you, but cost some health instead.

lycantropy-rage-name = Lunar rage
lycantropy-rage-desc = Gain the ability to ignore incoming stamina damage and receive a slight speed boost for several seconds.

lycantropy-tearing-name = Rending maw
lycantropy-tearing-desc = Strike with your jaws, dealing massive damage.

lycantropy-morph-name = Transformation
lycantropy-morph-desc = Gain the ability to transform into a werewolf and back at any time.
